 "summary": "Splunk's pipe-based Search Processing Language for searching, transforming and aggregating machine data and time-indexed events; commands such as search, eval, stats, timechart and rex are chained with |. SPL2 is a revised, SQL-compatible dialect for Splunk Cloud.",
 "status": "active",
